  "headline": "Explain how Ajrakh works from every angle: its history, geography, politics and chemistry.",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "lede.1",
      "text": "Myrobalan fruits contain high levels of tannic acid, and this tannin is an essential pre-mordant that helps later printed mordants hold on the cotton.",
      "level": "PROVISIONAL",
      "citations": [
        {
          "id": "724dcb33-e841-5462-b0a0-5627865d94f7",
