          "sourceId": "c1fa6a39-5386-5d7d-8623-393e1e61f6db",
          "quote": "these dried plums contain high levels of Tannic acid.",
          "locator": "Application 1050, method of production, p. 10",
          "context": null,
          "evidence": "QUOTED",
          "level": "PROVISIONAL"
        },
        {
          "id": "0ff3456e-6ac4-5c3a-8df2-ef3b556a87c9",
          "claimId": "5feb2829-74ac-5426-9893-8c9f80059de1",
          "sourceId": "c1fa6a39-5386-5d7d-8623-393e1e61f6db",
          "quote": "The tannin in the Myroballan penetrates the cotton fibres and is essential pre-mordant which aids the adhesion of the subsequent printed mordants onto the cloth.",
          "locator": "Application 1050, method of production, p. 10",
          "context": null,
          "evidence": "QUOTED",
          "level": "PROVISIONAL"
        }
      ],
      "translated": false,
      "terms": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lede.2",
      "text": "Pa, the red mordant paste, is alum suspended in boiled tamarind seed powder and printed on mavi, the parts of the design that must be red.",
      "level": "PROVISIONAL",
      "citations": [
        {
          "id": "b842380f-7d0b-56eb-97fb-f1c6c04ceaf3",
          "claimId": "9766f581-c81f-53ae-a60f-b7ab2c269406",
          "sourceId": "c1fa6a39-5386-5d7d-8623-393e1e61f6db",
          "quote": "The mordant, alum required for producing red is now applied to the cloth. Alum is suspended in a sticky paste of boiled powder from roasted and ground tamarind seeds (locally known as kachika).",
          "locator": "Application 1050, method of production, p. 11",
          "context": null,
          "evidence": "QUOTED",
          "level": "PROVISIONAL"
        },
        {
          "id": "928dafb2-0a32-5ab6-afad-3eca98b18bfb",
          "claimId": "9766f581-c81f-53ae-a60f-b7ab2c269406",
          "sourceId": "c1fa6a39-5386-5d7d-8623-393e1e61f6db",
          "quote": "This smooth paste called Pa, is printed with blocks which have been carved so that the printing portion of the raised face is patterned only, with the areas of the design called mavi, where red is required.",
          "locator": "Application 1050, method of production, p. 11",
          "context": null,
          "evidence": "QUOTED",
          "level": "PROVISIONAL"
        }
      ],
      "translated": false,
      "terms": [
        {
          "text": "alum",
          "termKey": "alum"
        }
      ]
    }
